  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The Joint Programme will foster municipal-level digital transformation to improve the provision of quality, gender-transformative services, and to incubate solutions and opportunities for local SDG accelerations and economic development. In Costa Rica, the limited digital capacity of municipalities has been holding them back in terms of improved governance, provision of quality public services,</narrative>
